sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant EJS as ethers.js
    participant MM as MetaMask
    participant RPC as JSON-RPC Node
    participant SC as Smart Contract
    participant BC as Blockchain

    Note over UI,BC: READ OPERATION (No Gas)
    
    UI->>EJS: contract.getElection(id)
    EJS->>RPC: eth_call
    RPC->>SC: Execute view function
    SC-->>RPC: Return data
    RPC-->>EJS: Encoded response
    EJS-->>UI: Decoded Election data

    Note over UI,BC: WRITE OPERATION (Requires Gas)

    UI->>EJS: contract.castBallot(id, p1, p2)
    EJS->>MM: eth_sendTransaction
    
    MM->>MM: Show confirmation popup
    
    alt User Rejects
        MM-->>EJS: Error: User rejected (4001)
        EJS-->>UI: Show rejection message
    else User Approves
        MM->>RPC: Signed transaction
        RPC->>BC: Include in block
        BC->>SC: Execute function
        
        alt Contract Reverts
            SC-->>RPC: Revert with custom error
            RPC-->>EJS: Transaction failed
            EJS-->>UI: Parse & show revert reason
        else Success
            SC->>BC: State updated + Event emitted
            BC-->>RPC: Transaction receipt
            RPC-->>EJS: Receipt (status=1)
            EJS-->>UI: Confirmation + tx hash
        end
    end

    Note over UI,BC: EVENT QUERY

    UI->>EJS: contract.queryFilter("BallotCast", fromBlock)
    EJS->>RPC: eth_getLogs
    RPC-->>EJS: Log entries
    EJS-->>UI: Parsed events array
